### Explored Factors

**Lagged cross-sectional relative residual momentum**

Construction:

\[
\text{ResidualMomentum}_{L,t}
=
\left(\sum_{i=0}^{L-1} r_{t-i}\right)
-
\operatorname{median}_{\text{assets}}
\left(\sum_{i=0}^{L-1} r_{t-i}\right)
\]

The signal was shifted by one trading day to avoid look-ahead bias. Lookbacks of 3, 7, 12, and 20 sessions were tested. The factor attempts to identify assets outperforming or underperforming the contemporaneous cross-asset median while reducing broad-market exposure.

