### Current Effective Factors

The factor library remains unchanged. Previously admitted factors maintained by other miners and prior cycles remain the current effective set, subject to their existing validation records. None of the three factors tested in this cycle is effective.

### Plans

- Re-test drawdown curvature with stronger smoothing and lower-frequency ranking to reduce its approximately 11% rank turnover.
- Investigate defensive drawdown signals conditioned on broad-market stress, VIX, and DXY regimes.
- Improve historical regime segmentation and verify data overlap before drawing early-versus-recent conclusions.
- Continue prioritizing low-turnover factors with full-universe coverage and 10-day predictive horizons.

